        </div>
        <p class="work__note" data-wd-reveal="up">
          Four builds, written up honestly instead of padded to twelve. The live sites are the
          proof, so please click through. There's more detail on each one over on the <a
            href="/web-design/work/">work page</a
          >. And if the site's fine but the funnel behind it isn't, that's the <a
            href="/consulting/">consulting side</a
          >.
        </p>
